usage: worker_source_pins.py [-h] (--check | --write)

Regenerate SDK fixture source pins from the fixed worker context; no build.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --check     Refuse stale pins without writing.
  --write     Regenerate only fixed SDK fixture source records.

Exit 0: verified/generated. Exit 2: invalid input or stale pins.
